WinPlay 1.1.0 — Roylyl
GPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE.

CarPlay control, pairing, encryption, plist and HID implementation adapted from
Roylyl/MacPlay, based on f-io/LIVI (Lasse Heitgres and contributors).
Wireless iAP2 identification and handoff adapted from Roylyl/AndroidPlay,
based on shihabal3amri/DiPlay. Original source comments are retained.
See vendor/MacPlay-NOTICE and docs/SOURCE-AUDIT.md.

No Apple endorsement or MFi certification is claimed. This locally built installation package embeds the authentication pair supplied
by the user. Credentials require separate redistribution authorization. MacPlay NOTICE
traces historical experimental credentials to DiPlay 0.2.6 APK; redistribution
authorization remains unestablished. GPL licensing of application code does not
grant rights to authentication credentials.

Electron (MIT), Chromium/FFmpeg and Node.js have their own bundled license texts.
@noble/curves (MIT), multicast-dns (MIT), plist (MIT) retain their licenses.
Wireless reception uses Windows Bluetooth and Wi-Fi; no Apple drivers are required.

The WinPlay icon is adapted from the AndroidPlay/MacPlay icon design family:
dark rounded tile, light-blue screen and play mark, with original CRT-style
monitor, pedestal, power light and four-pane window artwork. SVG source included.
